WEBVTT

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.950
Translator: Ladholyman
Timer/Typesetter: Maceart
Ending: Huzzah

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.950
Presented by Doremi-fansubs
www.doremi-fansubs.com
#doremi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.950
This story is a work of fiction.

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:37.490
February 2, 1591 - Ōmi Province - Ōtsu - Ishiyama Temple

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:44.750
I want the two of you to help out this stranded one-eyed dragon!

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:51.010
Save my ass!

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.130
The Man Who Destroyed the "World"

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.220
You're not joking, right?

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:17.380
I see. With that unyielding conviction,

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.670
you may be able to appease the Chief Advisor's fury.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.110
Your punishment may be lessened, too.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:29.450
But how do we do that without wearing white clothes?

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.790
Don't underestimate the men at the capital.

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:37.990
Interesting. As expected of Lord Oribe.

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:40.980
It's time to go all out then.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.170
Things are going smoothly, Brother.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:48.420
I had to hold back my beliefs after the ban.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:55.240
But I hope for this incident to raise the beliefs of the people towards God.

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:58.420
All that's left is for the citizens to go buck wild.

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:01.540
When Kyoto becomes a huge festival,

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:05.390
Master's punishment for the incident at Sanmon should be lessened.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:11.630
The Chief Advisor won't dare ruin the fun of a festival.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:17.150
That is the main difference between him and some normal general.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:26.740
It's nothing. Just the thought of Date parading himself...

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.870
A bit too crazy?

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.180
February 4 - Kyoto - Sanjō-dōri Street

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.130
What's this ruckus?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:51.080
I heard Lord Date is up to something interesting.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.730
Something interesting?

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.440
Will he be wearing white like last time?

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.030
White?

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:59.910
Come on! Hurry up!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:05.180
Master Shinbei, are you really going to sell everything?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:08.350
That's right. Orders from Lord Oribe.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:12.770
I think he wants to put on a show in front of the store.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:21.200
Master Rikyū...

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.900
Ah! Master Rikyū!

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:47.140
Come on, everyone!

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:50.370
General Date is here!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.870
What is that!?

00:05:16.570 --> 00:05:18.670
A golden cross!?

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:33.910
Oh! It's Date Masamune!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.210
S-So cool!

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:59.780
For your quarrel with the Chief Advisor's man, Lord Gamō,

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:04.340
and your incitement of the citizens of Ōushu, you have sinned!

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.220
What did you say!?

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:08.600
Milord! Follow the plan!

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:13.770
But you have reflected on your actions prior to your sentencing.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:18.510
You even carried a cross throughout the city. I am impressed.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:21.520
Thus, I, Furuta Oribe,

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.260
will not serve you water for your death, but tea instead!

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.780
Delicious!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:08:03.040
This tea bowl is also superb! I, Masamune, am being blinded by greatness!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:07.850
Wow!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.060
I don't really know what's going on...

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.420
but it feels amazing!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.200
What an interesting tea ceremony.

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:36.630
Take a good look at their faces.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:41.670
Brother practiced so many times just to let out that smile.

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.450
On the other hand, Date is betting his life on this.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.190
He's smiling at how cool he is.

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:52.740
I could say everything went just as planned,

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.000
but the reasons behind their smiles differ by quite a lot.

00:08:56.920 --> 00:09:01.220
I wonder which one the citizens of Kyoto will be more interested in?

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.110
I was waiting for this!

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:08.260
Imperfection shamperfection! I've had enough of that!

00:09:08.610 --> 00:09:13.260
I can relate to Date not flinching in front of the Chief Advisor!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.360
Goodness...

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:19.650
Young'uns nowadays always go with the flow.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:23.530
They're much too young to understand the elegance in simplicity.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.060
Their hotblooded emotions will fade fast...

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.140
What's your problem!?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.710
Hey! Women shouldn't scream out like that!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:39.180
You're distracting me! Just shut up and watch!

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.710
Lord Date's manliness!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:49.900
It's making me... making me...

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:57.580
so wet from top to bottom!

00:09:57.810 --> 00:09:59.400
You've been acting so strange.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:01.500
I'm chasing after Lord Date!

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:05.910
Wait, Okuni! Child dancer Okuni!

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:11.440
Setoya

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:11.440
Please wait and form a line to buy our tea bowls!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.180
Is he going with Date?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.940
This is not good. I wanted to invite Master to my residence tonight.

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:39.040
I need to tell him that my actions were to lessen his punishment for the Sanmon incident.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:44.040
But he saw the secret dealings between Date and I.

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.390
I must go and apologize.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:55.280
I need to tell him that I wasn't belittling the aesthetics of imperfection.

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:59.740
February 4 - Date Residence - Myōkaku Temple

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:06.660
We finally meet, Master Rikyū!

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:13.740
Please teach me the way of the tea!

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:17.350
That simplicity thing shaking the heavens!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:23.490
I've prepared a tea room already! I had my men build it!

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:28.080
I'll perform as many ceremonies as needed as long as I'm alive!

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:33.580
I am impressed by your admiration of me,

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:36.670
but I've hurt my hand.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.040
Just teach me with your words, then.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:44.500
Your presence is enough for me.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.340
Milord!

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:49.280
Many merchants from Kyoto have come to see you.

00:11:49.510 --> 00:11:51.350
They're waiting in the main hall.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.020
All right!

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.600
You come with me, too.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:00.390
When you get pardoned,

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:03.510
please come visit my store!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:08.060
You don't need to worry. The Chief Advisor is not heartless.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.930
He will be quite pleased at how bustling this city has become.

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:16.350
We'll have to continue the Date Festival for a while, then.

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:18.870
Let us forget about imperfection for a while...

00:12:23.110 --> 00:12:25.770
Excuse my rudeness, Master Rikyū.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:38.110
There are limits to our ambitions.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.080
Is this the limit of my abilities?

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:56.590
I will be heading to the other world before the Chief Advisor.

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:05.160
I will not leave silently. This shall be my final karma.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:24.900
He sent me a letter saying he'll visit in the evening.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.210
But I don't see Master.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:59.250
I have a premonition that perhaps I won't be able to speak with Master anymore.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:05.490
February 5 - Kyoto - Daitoku Temple

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:09.840
This is Master Rikyū's cherished item of imperfection,

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.890
the Hashitate tea pot.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.340
I would like to give it to you, Monk Kokei.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.650
If the Chief Advisor asks for it,

00:14:22.470 --> 00:14:26.280
please refrain from giving it to him.

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:36.880
What you are doing now, compounded with the Sanmon incident,

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.200
will make your punishment even harsher.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:45.370
Don't tell me you are prepared to die...?

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:51.360
Please do not be so hasty.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:53.480
We should wait for Lord Tokugawa's response, at least...

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:55.000
He will not take action.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:03.870
I had killed off the budding of true imperfection.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:10.510
No matter how much I fight, I am unable to forgive myself.

00:15:11.150 --> 00:15:13.270
Do you wish to be executed...?

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:21.600
But the Chief Advisor may not have the guts to do so.

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.230
However, my deeds will not go unpunished.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:33.790
The seeds of imperfection which I had killed off, those sins...

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.980
The pain of him being the one to kill me,

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.690
will fully allow him to comprehend the brevity of his crimes.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:47.830
That is how I will repay my loyalty to imperfection.

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:03.070
I need to head off to Jurakudai's treasury.

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:04.820
I'll take my leave here.

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.620
Master Rikyū!

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:12.420
Please do not concern yourself with me anymore.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:15.370
The heart of tea lies in Daitoku Temple.

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.690
You cannot let yourself be swayed by petty politics.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:22.890
February 6 - Jurakudai

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:27.680
You wrote this letter yourself, Masamune.

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:34.200
All of it is about planting the seeds of rebellion inside the hearts of Ōushu's citizens.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:38.990
What a joke, Chief Advisor.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:43.390
You can see there is a lack of a pinhole on the letter at the wagtail seal. I couldn't have wrote it!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.510
You better be thankful that the cross was golden.

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:53.860
If it was black...

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:02.570
You also have to thank the citizens of Kyoto.

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:07.300
Milord!

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:10.240
I'm taking back all of your land around Aizu.

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:12.730
Now calm the hell down, Gamō.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.120
Now that's that.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:18.460
Stop bothering me with your petty arguments.

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.780
Now give each other an embrace!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.120
Come on!

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:37.300
Perhaps your punishment for Date was a bit light?

00:17:37.980 --> 00:17:41.140
I want them to do all they can in our invasion of China.

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:43.150
That's why I let them go.

00:17:43.650 --> 00:17:46.960
Don't forget about your failure at Oshi Castle.

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:53.160
All right. But Master Rikyū cannot be punished lightly.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:18:01.160
Other than the Sanmon incident, he has been dealing unscrupulously with the monks.

00:18:01.880 --> 00:18:07.140
He is abusing his position as a high monk and bringing chaos to the world order.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.610
How should we punish him?

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:15.150
Like how we dealt with Yamanoue Sōji, by cutting off his head.

00:18:16.310 --> 00:18:19.920
We'll ignore the will of the citizens and the commanders?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:26.340
According to my surveys, the citizens are not as particularly fond of imperfection as before.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:32.470
You still allow him to sit on the throne of tea masters.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:36.870
I wonder why?

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.090
Rikyū! Save me!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:51.970
Rikyū!

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:57.770
You will never understand my feelings.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.200
But Milord...

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.610
Shut up!

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:05.960
February 9 - Kyoto - Hosokawa Tadaoki Residence

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:09.590
Master will be kicked out of Kyoto?

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:13.610
I asked Lord Maeda about it nonchalantly.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:17.160
That may be how they deal with the Sanmon incident.

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:23.000
I heard Kita no Mandokoro and the Head Advisor both asked for leniency.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:25.830
But thank goodness.

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:30.300
The Chief Advisor is not that cold-blooded.

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.620
I'm at ease, too.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.870
I wonder if it's due to God's blessings...

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:39.830
But the Date Festival seems to have worked.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.270
But to be exiled is too much!

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.610
That damn Ishida.

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:48.910
He wants to further his position by doing this.

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:50.780
Calm down.

00:19:51.260 --> 00:19:53.570
After some time he'll be able to return.

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:54.660
That's right.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:20:00.480
I was exiled before, and I'm right back here in Kyoto.

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:01.340
No!

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:05.340
The other aesthetes will also not stand for this!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:07.300
Just think about it!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:09.530
Once the Master has been exiled,

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.770
won't the ones who revered him be targeted next?

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:15.760
This is something that will shake the very heavens!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:19.840
Before the ruling is set,

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:23.060
we must find a way so Master will not be exiled!

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:26.550
February 10 - Kyoto - Jurakudai

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.370
Let me tell you this about my ruling.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:38.060
You will be under house arrest in Sakai.

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:41.320
You will repent long and hard on your actions.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:47.370
This is the last time, Rikyū.

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.790
Rate my tea.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:19.220
Thank you for all that you've done, Lord Hideyoshi.

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:04.750
That's...

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:07.100
The Narashiba!

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:06.310
Everytime I　

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:06.310
Anata no mune

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:08.700
feel your heart

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:08.700
Fureru sonotabi

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:14.790
Your burning, sincere passion singes me.

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:14.790
Yakedoshisou na shinshi na jounetsu

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:20.970
Were the world to turn against you, my dear love

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:20.970
Sekai juu wo teki ni mawashitatte

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:27.130
Oppose its rotation and return to me.

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:27.130
Mezashitanara douzo tsuranuite kudasai

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:33.220
Men are alike butterflies, as women are alike flowers.

00:23:27.970 --> 00:23:33.220
Otoko wa chouchou de onna wa hana de

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:37.100
Through heaven and earth,

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:37.100
Kuu to daichi to demo

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:40.680
Are also alike, we all choose to live.

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:40.680
Onaji asu wo eraberuno

00:23:40.880 --> 00:23:46.550
Should we be seperated by the flow of time?

00:23:40.880 --> 00:23:46.550
Toki ni nagasare kyouri ni hanasareru

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.550
We must continue living our lives

00:23:46.650 --> 00:23:49.550
Kizuna nante kizunajynai

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:52.160
Without each other.

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:52.160
Omoumama ikite　

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:53.120
You should

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:53.120
Soshite

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:58.620
Ascend the heavens and look below.

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:58.620
Nobotta itadakikara mieru

00:23:58.730 --> 00:24:02.410
Show me the scenery in my dreams.

00:23:58.730 --> 00:24:02.410
Keshiki wo oshiete itsuka

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:08.120
Even though we fall in love and drown in passion,

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:08.120
Koi ni ochiteku ai ni oboreteku

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:14.610
I desire my wish fulfilled, above this happiness we both share.

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:14.610
Watashi no kono shiawase yori kanaetai negai sore wa

00:24:14.670 --> 00:24:20.410
I desire your pursuit of beautiful things.

00:24:14.670 --> 00:24:20.410
Anata no ou utsukushii mono

00:24:21.890 --> 00:24:26.390
So abide by my desire, for eternity.

00:24:21.890 --> 00:24:26.390
Kowasarenaide eien ni

00:24:34.390 --> 00:24:36.190
Please become strong.

00:24:39.630 --> 00:24:41.290
No need to answer!

00:24:47.960 --> 00:24:49.640
Have Rikyū commit seppuku...

00:24:50.170 --> 00:24:52.500
Dusk at Yodo River.

00:24:53.430 --> 00:24:54.690
To be a warrior or an aesthete?

00:24:55.370 --> 00:24:57.770
That is the question.

00:24:56.360 --> 00:24:59.650
Dusk at Yodo River
